/T (We are Horizon \(FTC 36596\), a dedicated group of high school students based in Oregon that seeks to become the best in the robotics program named the FIRST Tech Challenge \(FTC\). Originally founded in 2026 by leaders from three existing teams, our community, nonprofit team seeks to combine experience from the some of the most dedicated students in the world to learn new skills, spread knowledge, and create excellence in everything we do.)
